  "necessary_condition": "A limit of projectively transformed twisted cubics supplies a limiting 3-space of quadrics with at least two independent linear syzygies. If seven target points impose rank 7 on quadrics, their common-quadric space has dimension 3 and must have syzygy dimension at least 2 to lie on such a limit.",
